stateDiagram-v2
    state "NO-GO" as NO_GO
    [*] --> cmd_preflight : cmd_stack
    cmd_preflight --> NO_GO : a check printed NO-GO, returns 1
    cmd_preflight --> UNKNOWN : no NO-GO, a check printed UNKNOWN, returns 2
    cmd_preflight --> GO : every check printed GO, returns 0

    GO --> cdk_diff
    UNKNOWN --> cdk_diff : ALLOW_UNKNOWN=1
    UNKNOWN --> not_deploying : ALLOW_UNKNOWN is not 1
    NO_GO --> not_deploying

    cdk_diff --> not_deploying : nothing to create, or [~] or [-] items, or another stack or CDKToolkit
    cdk_diff --> confirm : only [+] items in stack claude-ecs
    confirm --> cdk_deploy : typed account id matches, or ASSUME_YES=1 with EXPECTED_ACCOUNT
    confirm --> not_deploying : not confirmed
    cdk_deploy --> [*]
    not_deploying --> [*]
